[N 41-42 Powderfuse Port]
[D Forever Shaman 30-60 (Braedyn)\\The neutral goblin port on the Riverglades east coast: Gelinda Coppergleam's Cinderscale quests in the west, then Wharfmaster Whizzbuzz's murloc and Eastsea pirate war (Admiral Lamora and the three boats), the WANTED poster for Trapclaw, Sleebo's marsh-gas tests and, if you brought the lion hides, Friz Frazzlespark's smuggling quests. Hearth stays Farholde Keep. Last chapter of round 1.]
[GA Alliance]
[OC]|cffffffffLevel check|r  -  this chapter wants level 41. The highest required level of its quests is 38, but the mobs are the limit: Cinderscale Warriors 41-42, the Eastsea pirates' Bombardiers 43-44 and Raiders 44-45, and Admiral Lamora 45. Under 41: do Gelinda's whelps, Sleebo, the murlocs and Trapclaw first and leave Unchecked Expansion (95122) and Admiral Lamora (95124) for last; if Lamora is still too much, abandon 95124 rather than wait
[OC]|cffffffffPowderfuse Port|r  -  the neutral goblin port on the east coast of the Riverglades. You start in Farholde Keep after chapter 40, hearth = Farholde Keep and it stays there: the port has no flight path, and every leg here is within ~35 units of it. About 37,950 quest XP on the plain quests and 2g 25s of quest money. Givers and hand-ins come from the DB; the points marked "Wowhead's map" have no position in it
[OC]|cffffcc00Carried in:|r A Few Furs for Friz (94928) only if you did chapter 38's optional A Fur Trade: it opens Friz Frazzlespark's block below. Stepped Out (95961) only if Tessa Dawnbright offered it in chapter 38: Gray Dawnbright is in the port
[OC]|cffffcc00Training:|r no shaman trainer here; the port's trainers (Krix the fisherman, Grungle the miner, Melbin Powderfuse the engineer) are not on the route

[OC]|cffffffffGelinda Coppergleam|r  -  west first, to the Cinderscale dragonkin. The road from Farholde Keep is not in the data (Watcher Fredericks at Southern Watch, 36.4,75.8, is on the way)
Ride west from Farholde Keep to Gelinda Coppergleam (road unverified) [G30.2,69.0 Riverglades]
At [TAR262399 Gelinda Coppergleam], [QA95792 Clear 'em Out] (3,450 XP: 8 Cinderscale Whelps and 4 Cinderscale Warriors) [QA95934 Proof of Profit] (3,450 XP: 1 Cubic Draconia from the crystal south of her) [G30.2,69.0 Riverglades]
[OC]Cinderscale Whelps are 39-40 and Warriors 41-42, both normal, around 30,72. |cFFFF0000Danger:|r Scaldaron, a level-43 rare elite, stands at their east edge right beside the crystal (30.4-31.3,72.2-73.0)
Kill [TAR262473 Cinderscale Whelp] and [TAR262477 Cinderscale Warrior] (8 and 4) round Gelinda's dragonkin camp [QC95792] [G30.0,72.4 Riverglades]
Look for Scaldaron first (rare elite, 43, right beside the crystal). If he is not there, loot the Cubic Draconia (100%). If he is, pull the Cinderscales away from the crystal side, wait a few minutes for him to wander or for a group [QC95934] [G30.1,73.3 Riverglades]
[O]If Scaldaron stays by the crystal: abandon Proof of Profit - do not fight him alone [QS95934] [G30.1,73.3 Riverglades]
